\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jWjqVWNOSOAQ7kNvwF1yiGf&_nc_oc=AdkiNLnzhHc1xgc6-Ipr9_pctW58hI30kNnZnubNI0qi-mCzY4OkDAPi9sRRsZ7hlg8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsgYYpVFizPhSvep-wKdWeSlNLQwjivVJkiDlljA6Gt1Q&oe=69A815F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VM-SVuZXvFYQ7kNvwFeWpDp&_nc_oc=AdlePW2oS2pe5wj8rUT_Uio0iRxA4Ns5UhseMkMr_o0J-RAiB9t44SNCjkf9VwH75Sk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftLx1nwm70zKsOeK9wsC18jo8SQTFw1ZdHISRdlvITeJA&oe=69A81756"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dwCj0WbI-DQQ7kNvwFu8gzy&_nc_oc=Adk2GpPkw8NLMqA6-JbRg8hylfx0wE0MCk5zwoASevV3x8ap-eyAW8LmZbk6b0x-I8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuCsigef2-N3hVH5OJh-Uun-psd90VPj-KtZ_o3ttjuUQ&oe=69A82C77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771